# Models Crawl4AI may use to answer a `query`, best first. One per line, named
# the way opencode runs them. The free list on OpenCode Go changes without
# notice, so this file is read on every request: add a line, drop a line, no
# rebuild and no restart. If one fails the next is tried, and if they all fail
# the query falls back to a keyword filter with no model at all. The whole
# phase has a two minute budget, so a long list is cut short rather than kept
# waiting on.
#
# Commented-out lines cost nothing. An empty file means no LLM.
opencode-go/hy4-flash-free
opencode-go/longcat-2.5-free
opencode-go/iceman-contributor-free
opencode-go/beam-free
